    "instructions": "Link the change register entry and current Scope. Capture impacts before seeking a decision; a request is not approval. Update the same Scope and native project data only after the relevant decision, retaining prior evidence. Use Fields for concise metadata and the titled Rich text objects for detailed content. Required Fields describe expected information; incomplete drafts may be saved. Ask for missing facts when needed; never invent people, dates, references or results. References identify sources and do not grant access. These Fields do not change Workmap execution state.",
